{
    "title": "Easy Words - Word Puzzle Games",
    "description": "Easy Words is a fun and addictive word game to train your brain. Make words with letters to get as many points as you can! Take a break and show off your logic skills while competing with opponents for a higher score!\r\n\r\nIn this word puzzle game, players take turns to compose words with the letters from their deck. Each letter has its own points. The main goal is to reach the highest score by making words on the board with your letters. Unscramble words and sharpen your mind, anytime and anywhere.\r\n\r\nThe rules of Easy Words are quite simple:\r\n\r\n- This word puzzle game is played on a 13x13 board.\r\n- You and your opponent receive 7 tiles with letters on them from a tile bag. You have to connect letters in different ways and place the tiles on the board to make a word.\r\n- Words can be formed either horizontally or vertically, much like in crosswords.\r\n- The player who starts the word game should place a word containing at least two letters onto the board with at least one tile placed in the central square.\r\n- There are 44 bonus cells on the board. They allow you to multiply the points you receive either for a letter or the whole word if a tile with a letter is placed on one of them.\r\n- If you receive a tile with a joker, lucky you! It can substitute any letter you need while playing word puzzle games.\r\n- The game is over when either player uses the last tile, or both of them skip two moves in a row, or if either player has no possible moves left. Also, it is possible to resign from the word game. However, this means that your opponent wins.\r\n- The user with the higher score at the end of the game wins.\r\n\r\nEasy Words features:\r\n\r\n- Word definition. The built-in dictionary provides the definition of all the words added onto the board. This is an excellent opportunity to enrich your vocabulary and master new words while playing free word games for adults!\r\n- Hints. If you are stuck solving word puzzles, simply use a hint. It will compose the best possible word with the letters you have, taking into account bonus cells to maximize the number of points you can receive during your turn.\r\n- Swap. If you have run out of ideas and don\u2019t know what you can create with the tiles you have, just swap the tiles in your deck to collect a few random letters from the tile bag. This is a classic way to get some inspiration and compose words with your new letters!\r\n- Shuffle. This is one of the classic word games that offer an opportunity to shuffle the tiles in your deck. Get a fresh perspective on your letters to find a new word!\r\n\r\nIf you have ever tried to unscramble words or played other classic free word puzzles with friends, Easy Words is a great option for a pleasant and fun pastime. Solve your first word puzzle and dive into the immersive game experience. Accept the challenge, make as many words as you can and train your brain!\r\n\r\nTerms of Use:\r\nhttps://easybrain.com/terms\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\r\nhttps://easybrain.com/privacy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Easy Words is a fun and addictive word game to train your brain. Make words with letters to get as many points as you can! Take a break and show off your logic skills while competing with opponents for a higher score!<br><br>In this word puzzle game, players take turns to compose words with the letters from their deck. Each letter has its own points. The main goal is to reach the highest score by making words on the board with your letters. Unscramble words and sharpen your mind, anytime and anywhere.<br><br>The rules of Easy Words are quite simple:<br><br>- This word puzzle game is played on a 13x13 board.<br>- You and your opponent receive 7 tiles with letters on them from a tile bag. You have to connect letters in different ways and place the tiles on the board to make a word.<br>- Words can be formed either horizontally or vertically, much like in crosswords.<br>- The player who starts the word game should place a word containing at least two letters onto the board with at least one tile placed in the central square.<br>- There are 44 bonus cells on the board. They allow you to multiply the points you receive either for a letter or the whole word if a tile with a letter is placed on one of them.<br>- If you receive a tile with a joker, lucky you! It can substitute any letter you need while playing word puzzle games.<br>- The game is over when either player uses the last tile, or both of them skip two moves in a row, or if either player has no possible moves left. Also, it is possible to resign from the word game. However, this means that your opponent wins.<br>- The user with the higher score at the end of the game wins.<br><br>Easy Words features:<br><br>- Word definition. The built-in dictionary provides the definition of all the words added onto the board. This is an excellent opportunity to enrich your vocabulary and master new words while playing free word games for adults!<br>- Hints. If you are stuck solving word puzzles, simply use a hint. It will compose the best possible word with the letters you have, taking into account bonus cells to maximize the number of points you can receive during your turn.<br>- Swap. If you have run out of ideas and don\u2019t know what you can create with the tiles you have, just swap the tiles in your deck to collect a few random letters from the tile bag. This is a classic way to get some inspiration and compose words with your new letters!<br>- Shuffle. This is one of the classic word games that offer an opportunity to shuffle the tiles in your deck. Get a fresh perspective on your letters to find a new word!<br><br>If you have ever tried to unscramble words or played other classic free word puzzles with friends, Easy Words is a great option for a pleasant and fun pastime. Solve your first word puzzle and dive into the immersive game experience. Accept the challenge, make as many words as you can and train your brain!<br><br>Terms of Use:<br>https://easybrain.com/terms<br><br>Privacy Policy:<br>https://easybrain.com/privacy",
